        "title": "Choose who owns the Linear OAuth app",
        "description": "On hosted Veryfront, Linear uses the Veryfront-managed Linear OAuth app: connect Linear from the project's integrations and approve the Linear consent screen, no environment variables needed. Set LINEAR_CLIENT_ID and LINEAR_CLIENT_SECRET only to use your own Linear OAuth app, which is required for local and self-hosted runs."
